Table full name: bigquery-public-data.sec_quarterly_financials.rendering
Column name: submission_number Type: STRING Description: Accession Number. The 20-character string formed from the 18-digit number assigned by the Commission to each EDGAR submission. submission_number: [adsh]
Column name: report Type: INT64 Description: Represents the report grouping. The numeric value refers to the \"R file\" as computed by the renderer and posted on the EDGAR website. Note that in some situations the numbers skip.
Column name: file_type Type: STRING Description: The type of interactive data file rendered on the EDGAR website, H = .htm file, X = .xml file. file_type: [rfile]
Column name: menu_category Type: STRING Description: If available, one of the menu categories as computed by the renderer: C=Cover, S=Statements, N=Notes, P=Policies, T=Tables, D=Details, O=Other, and U=Uncategorized. menu_category: [menucat]
Column name: shortname Type: STRING Description: The portion of the long name used in the renderer menu.
Column name: longname Type: STRING Description: The space-normalized text of the XBRL link \"definition\" element content.
Column name: roleuri Type: STRING Description: The XBRL \"roleuri\" of the role.
Column name: parentroleuri Type: STRING Description: The XBRL roleuri of a role for which this role has a matching shortname prefix and a higher level menu category, as computed by the renderer.
Column name: parentreport Type: INT64 Description: The value of the report field for the role where roleuri equals this parentroleuri.
Column name: ultimate_parent_report Type: INT64 Description: The highest ancestor report reachable by following parentreport relationships. A note (menucat = N) is its own ultimate parent. ultimate_parent_report: [ultparentrpt]
Column name: _PARTITIONTIME Type: TIMESTAMP
Sample rows:
[{'submission_number': '0001558370-18-000022', 'report': 85, 'file_type': 'H', 'menu_category': 'D', 'shortname': "STOCKHOLDERS' EQUITY", 'longname': "41503 - Disclosure - STOCKHOLDERS' EQUITY - Dividends (Details)", 'roleuri': 'http://www.lambweston.com/role/DisclosureStockholdersEquityDividendsDetails', 'parentroleuri': None, 'parentreport': None, 'ultimate_parent_report': None}, {'submission_number': '0001558370-18-000022', 'report': 86, 'file_type': 'H', 'menu_category': 'D', 'shortname': "STOCKHOLDERS' EQUITY", 'longname': "41504 - Disclosure - STOCKHOLDERS' EQUITY - Changes in AOCI (Details)", 'roleuri': 'http://www.lambweston.com/role/DisclosureStockholdersEquityChangesInAociDetails', 'parentroleuri': None, 'parentreport': None, 'ultimate_parent_report': None}, {'submission_number': '0001558370-18-000022', 'report': 87, 'file_type': 'H', 'menu_category': 'D', 'shortname': "STOCKHOLDERS' EQUITY", 'longname': "41505 - Disclosure - STOCKHOLDERS' EQUITY - AOCI - Settlement Gains on 


