Table full name: bigquery-public-data.sec_quarterly_financials.presentation
Column name: submission_number Type: STRING Description: Accession Number. The 20-character string formed from the 18-digit number assigned by the Commission to each EDGAR submission. submission_number: [adsh]
Column name: report Type: INT64 Description: Represents the report grouping. The numeric value refers to the \"R file\" as computed by the renderer and posted on the EDGAR website. Note that in some situations the numbers skip.
Column name: line Type: INT64 Description: Represents the tag's presentation line order for a given report. Together with the statement and report field, presentation location, order and grouping can be derived.
Column name: statement Type: STRING Description: The financial statement location to which the value of the \"report\" field pertains. statement: [stmt]
Column name: presented_parenthetically Type: BOOL Description: 1 indicates that the value was presented \"parenthetically\" instead of in fields within the financial statements. For example: Receivables (net of allowance for bad debts of USD 200 in 2012) USD 700 presented_parenthetically: [inpth]
Column name: rfile Type: STRING Description: The type of interactive data file rendered on the EDGAR website, H = .htm file, X = .xml file.
Column name: measure_tag Type: STRING Description: The tag chosen by the filer for this line item. measure_tag: [tag]
Column name: version Type: STRING Description: The taxonomy identifier if the tag is a standard tag, otherwise adsh.
Column name: preferred_role Type: STRING Description: The XBRL link \"role\" of the preferred label, using only the portion of the role URI after the last \"/\". preferred_role: [prole]
Column name: preferred_label Type: STRING Description: The text presented on the line item, also known as a \"preferred\" label. preferred_label: [plabel]
Column name: negating Type: BOOL Description: Flag to indicate whether the prole is treated as negating by the renderer.
Column name: _PARTITIONTIME Type: TIMESTAMP
Sample rows:
[{'submission_number': '0001217160-19-000006', 'report': 1, 'line': 1, 'statement': 'CP', 'presented_parenthetically': False, 'rfile': None, 'measure_tag': 'EntityRegistrantName', 'version': 'dei/2014', 'preferred_role': 'label', 'preferred_label': 'Entity Registrant Name', 'negating': False}, {'submission_number': '0001558370-19-000568', 'report': 1, 'line': 1, 'statement': 'CP', 'presented_parenthetically': False, 'rfile': None, 'measure_tag': 'EntityRegistrantName', 'version': 'dei/2014', 'preferred_role': 'label', 'preferred_label': 'Entity Registrant Name', 'negating': False}, {'submission_number': '0001144204-19-011650', 'report': 1, 'line': 1, 'statement': 'CP', 'presented_parenthetically': False, 'rfile': None, 'measure_tag': 'EntityRegistrantName', 'version': 'dei/2014', 'preferred_role': 'label', 'preferred_label': 'Entity Registrant Name', 'negating': False}, {'submission_number': '0001511164-19-000012', 'report': 1, 'line': 1, 'statement': 'CP', 'presented_parenthetically':


