Table full name: bigquery-public-data.sec_quarterly_financials.dimension
Column name: segments_hash Type: STRING Description: MD5 hash of the segments field text. Although MD5 is unsuitable for cryptographic use, it is used here merely to limit the size of the primary key. segments_hash: [dimhash]
Column name: segments Type: STRING Description: Concatenation of tag names representing the axis and members appearing in the XBRL segments. Tag names have their first characters \"Statement\", last 4 characters \"Axis\", and last 6 characters \"Member\" or \"Domain\" truncated where they appear. Namespaces and prefixes are ignored because EDGAR validation guarantees that the local-names are unique with a submission. Each dimension is represented as the pair \"{axis}={member};\" and the axes concatenated in lexical order. Example: \"LegalEntity=Xyz;Scenario=Restated;\" represents the XBRL segment with dimension LegalEntityAxis and member XyzMember, dimension StatementScenarioAxis and member RestatedMember.
Column name: segment_truncation Type: BOOL Description: TRUE if the segments field would have been longer than 1024 characters had it not been truncated, else FALSE. segment_truncation: [segt]
Column name: _PARTITIONTIME Type: TIMESTAMP
Sample rows:
[{'segments_hash': '0x00000000', 'segments': None, 'segment_truncation': False}, {'segments_hash': '0x0cfab777bfb97c9c70428f4aa168335c', 'segments': 'PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByType=NonProducingOilAndGasProperties;', 'segment_truncation': False}, {'segments_hash': '0x0fbb52a9c45f6b71e15f9014faa85f56', 'segments': 'PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByType=SouthTexasProjectAcreage;', 'segment_truncation': False}, {'segments_hash': '0x133ed0334b7713ac9a34d0512f7d9f1a', 'segments': 'DerivativeInstrumentRisk=PutOption;', 'segment_truncation': False}, {'segments_hash': '0x1767e6cfc42e170f20b295eb0caaa6cc', 'segments': 'ConsolidationItems=OperatingSegments;BusinessSegments=AllOtherSegments;', 'segment_truncation': False}]

